{"page":352,"verses":[{"verse_key":"24:21","surah":24,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"۞ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَا تَتَّبِعُوا۟ خُطُوَٰتِ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ ۚ وَمَن يَتَّبِعْ خُطُوَٰتِ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ فَإِنَّهُۥ يَأْمُرُ بِٱلْفَحْشَآءِ وَٱلْمُنكَرِ ۚ وَلَوْلَا فَضْلُ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْكُمْ وَرَحْمَتُهُۥ مَا زَكَىٰ مِنكُم مِّنْ أَحَدٍ أَبَدًا وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُزَكِّى مَن يَشَآءُ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ سَمِيعٌ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, do not follow in Satan’s footsteps- if you do so, he will urge you to indecency and evil. If it were not for God’s bounty and mercy towards you, not one of you would ever have attained purity. God purifies whoever He will: God is all hearing, all seeing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَتَّبِعُوا۟","en_gloss":"follow","transliteration":"tattabiʿū","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خُطُوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(the) footsteps","transliteration":"khuṭuwāti","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَتَّبِعْ","en_gloss":"follows","transliteration":"yattabiʿ","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خُطُوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(the) footsteps","transliteration":"khuṭuwāti","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَإِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"then indeed, he","transliteration":"fa-innahu","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَأْمُرُ","en_gloss":"commands","transliteration":"yamuru","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِٱلْفَحْشَآءِ","en_gloss":"the immorality","transliteration":"bil-faḥshāi","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱلْمُنكَرِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the evil","transliteration":"wal-munkari","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلَوْلَا","en_gloss":"And if not","transliteration":"walawlā","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَضْلُ","en_gloss":"(for the) Grace of Allah","transliteration":"faḍlu","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(for the) Grace of Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":19,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَرَحْمَتُهُۥ","en_gloss":"and His Mercy","transliteration":"waraḥmatuhu","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":21,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":22,"ar":"زَكَىٰ","en_gloss":"(would) have been pure","transliteration":"zakā","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":23,"ar":"مِنكُم","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":24,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"anyone","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":25,"ar":"أَحَدٍ","en_gloss":"anyone","transliteration":"aḥadin","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":26,"ar":"أَبَدًۭا","en_gloss":"ever","transliteration":"abadan","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":27,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":28,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":29,"ar":"يُزَكِّى","en_gloss":"purifies","transliteration":"yuzakkī","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":30,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":31,"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۗ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":32,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":33,"ar":"سَمِيعٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Hearer","transliteration":"samīʿun","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":34,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"24:21"},{"pos":35,"ar":"٢١","en_gloss":"(21)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:21"}]},{"verse_key":"24:22","surah":24,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا يَأْتَلِ أُو۟لُوا۟ ٱلْفَضْلِ مِنكُمْ وَٱلسَّعَةِ أَن يُؤْتُوٓا۟ أُو۟لِى ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ وَٱلْمَسَـٰكِينَ وَٱلْمُهَـٰجِرِينَ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ۖ وَلْيَعْفُوا۟ وَلْيَصْفَحُوٓا۟ ۗ أَلَا تُحِبُّونَ أَن يَغْفِرَ ٱللَّهُ لَكُمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who have been graced with bounty and plenty should not swear that they will [no longer] give to kinsmen, the poor, those who emigrated in God’s way: let them pardon and forgive. Do you not wish that God should forgive you? God is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَأْتَلِ","en_gloss":"let swear","transliteration":"yatali","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُو۟لُوا۟","en_gloss":"those of virtue","transliteration":"ulū","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْفَضْلِ","en_gloss":"those of virtue","transliteration":"l-faḍli","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلسَّعَةِ","en_gloss":"and the amplitude of means","transliteration":"wal-saʿati","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُؤْتُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they give","transliteration":"yu'tū","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أُو۟لِى","en_gloss":"(to) the near of kin","transliteration":"ulī","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ","en_gloss":"(to) the near of kin","transliteration":"l-qur'bā","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلْمَسَـٰكِينَ","en_gloss":"and the needy","transliteration":"wal-masākīna","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱلْمُهَـٰجِرِينَ","en_gloss":"and the emigrants","transliteration":"wal-muhājirīna","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":14,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلْيَعْفُوا۟","en_gloss":"And let them pardon","transliteration":"walyaʿfū","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَلْيَصْفَحُوٓا۟ ۗ","en_gloss":"and let them overlook","transliteration":"walyaṣfaḥū","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَلَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"alā","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":19,"ar":"تُحِبُّونَ","en_gloss":"you like","transliteration":"tuḥibbūna","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":20,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":21,"ar":"يَغْفِرَ","en_gloss":"Allah should forgive","transliteration":"yaghfira","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":22,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah should forgive","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":23,"ar":"لَكُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":24,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":25,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":26,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"24:22"},{"pos":27,"ar":"٢٢","en_gloss":"(22)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:22"}]},{"verse_key":"24:23","surah":24,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَرْمُونَ ٱلْمُحْصَنَـٰتِ ٱلْغَـٰفِلَـٰتِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ لُعِنُوا۟ فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who accuse honourable but unwary believing women are rejected by God, in this life and the next. A painful punishment awaits them","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَرْمُونَ","en_gloss":"accuse","transliteration":"yarmūna","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمُحْصَنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the chaste women","transliteration":"l-muḥ'ṣanāti","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْغَـٰفِلَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the unaware women","transliteration":"l-ghāfilāti","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"(and) the believing women","transliteration":"l-mu'mināti","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لُعِنُوا۟","en_gloss":"are cursed","transliteration":"luʿinū","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"and the Hereafter","transliteration":"wal-ākhirati","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"And for them","transliteration":"walahum","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَذَابٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَظِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","verse_key":"24:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢٣","en_gloss":"(23)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:23"}]},{"verse_key":"24:24","surah":24,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"يَوْمَ تَشْهَدُ عَلَيْهِمْ أَلْسِنَتُهُمْ وَأَيْدِيهِمْ وَأَرْجُلُهُم بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"on the Day when their own tongues, hands, and feet will testify against them about what they have done-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(On a) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"24:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَشْهَدُ","en_gloss":"will bear witness","transliteration":"tashhadu","verse_key":"24:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"against them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"24:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَلْسِنَتُهُمْ","en_gloss":"th