"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمُبِينُ","en_gloss":"the Manifest","transliteration":"l-mubīnu","verse_key":"24:25"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:25"}]},{"verse_key":"24:26","surah":24,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلْخَبِيثَـٰتُ لِلْخَبِيثِينَ وَٱلْخَبِيثُونَ لِلْخَبِيثَـٰتِ ۖ وَٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتُ لِلطَّيِّبِينَ وَٱلطَّيِّبُونَ لِلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ مُبَرَّءُونَ مِمَّا يَقُولُونَ ۖ لَهُم مَّغْفِرَةٌ وَرِزْقٌ كَرِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Corrupt women are for corrupt men, and corrupt men are for corrupt women; good women are for good men and good men are for good women. The good are innocent of what has been said against them; they will have forgiveness and a generous provision.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلْخَبِيثَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"Evil women","transliteration":"al-khabīthātu","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلْخَبِيثِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) for evil men","transliteration":"lil'khabīthīna","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱلْخَبِيثُونَ","en_gloss":"and evil men","transliteration":"wal-khabīthūna","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِلْخَبِيثَـٰتِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(are) for evil women","transliteration":"lil'khabīthāti","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"And good women","transliteration":"wal-ṭayibātu","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِلطَّيِّبِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) for good men","transliteration":"lilṭṭayyibīna","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلطَّيِّبُونَ","en_gloss":"and good men","transliteration":"wal-ṭayibūna","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(are) for good women","transliteration":"lilṭṭayyibāti","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مُبَرَّءُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) innocent","transliteration":"mubarraūna","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِمَّا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَقُولُونَ ۖ","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"For them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَّغْفِرَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) forgiveness","transliteration":"maghfiratun","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَرِزْقٌۭ","en_gloss":"and a provision","transliteration":"wariz'qun","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":16,"ar":"كَرِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"noble","transliteration":"karīmun","verse_key":"24:26"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٢٦","en_gloss":"(26)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:26"}]},{"verse_key":"24:27","surah":24,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَا تَدْخُلُوا۟ بُيُوتًا غَيْرَ بُيُوتِكُمْ حَتَّىٰ تَسْتَأْنِسُوا۟ وَتُسَلِّمُوا۟ عَلَىٰٓ أَهْلِهَا ۚ ذَٰلِكُمْ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَذَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, do not enter other people’s houses until you have asked permission to do so and greeted those inside- that is best for you: perhaps you will bear this in mind.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"24:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"24:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"24:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"24:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَدْخُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"enter","transliteration":"tadkhulū","verse_key":"24:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بُيُوتًا","en_gloss":"houses","transliteration":"buyūtan","verse_key":"24:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"غَيْرَ","en_gloss":"other (than)","transliteration":"ghayra","verse_key":"24:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بُيُوتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your houses","transliteration":"buyūtikum","verse_key":"24:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"24:27"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَسْتَأْنِسُوا۟","en_gloss":"you have asked permission","transliteration":"tastanisū","verse_key":"24:27"},{"p